				},
				{
					"id": 732750305,
					"content": "Did you indeed? Well, I suppose that the seeds Uncle Shafaqat sowed really did find their way back here in the end after being spread to every corner of the desert — even if the path they took meandered quite a bit.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732750307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Affan"
				},
				{
					"id": 732750307,
					"content": "We'll have to take good care of these seedlings — I intend to leave them to young Sabbah. Once I, too, am gone, these flowers shall pass on to her.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732750308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Affan"
				},
				{
					"id": 732750308,
					"content": "You've truly helped this old man out, and you asked for no reward — but ah, I would have trouble sleeping tonight if I didn't give you a little something at least.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732750309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Affan"
				},
				{
					"id": 732750309,
					"content": "This seedling recently broke through the soil, and Sabbah suggested giving it to you. She even wrapped it up nicely.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732750310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Affan"
				},
				{
					"id": 732750310,
					"content": "Take it as a memento from us. May you be as resilient as this seedling, and may you always keep the faith.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Affan"
				}
			]
		},
